# Python bytecode from the evaluation harnesses. Two .pyc files were tracked
# and rewritten on every run, putting binary churn in the diff of any change
# that touched a harness.
__pycache__/

# Binaries a bare `go build ./cmd/...` drops in the repo root. The scripts here
# build into runtime/, but an ad-hoc build does not, and `git add -A` will
# happily commit 8MB of it.
/cass-agent
/cass-broker-exec
/cass-broker-plan
/cass-chat
/cass-notify
